#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:770
#, fuzzy
msgid "Reboot the system to the new kernel."
msgstr "重新启动系统以使用新的核心。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:772
