#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:783
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preparing for a Source Update"
msgstr "准备源码更新"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:786
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Read [.filename]#/usr/src/UPDATING#. Any manual steps that must be performed "
"before or after an update are described in this file."
msgstr ""
"阅读<filename>/usr/src/UPDATING</filename>，从源码编译之前与之后任何需要手动"
"操作步骤会在此文件中说明。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:788
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updating the Source"
msgstr "更新源码"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:793
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"FreeBSD source code is located in [.filename]#/usr/src/#.  The preferred "
"method of updating this source is through the Git version control system.  "
"Verify that the source code is under version control:"
msgstr "FreeBSD 源代码位于 [.filename]#/usr/src/#。更新此源代码的首选方法是使用 Git 版本控制系统。请确认源代码受版本控制："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:800
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# cd /usr/src\n"
"# git remote --v\n"
"origin  https://git.freebsd.org/src.git (fetch)\n"
"origin  https://git.freebsd.org/src.git (push)\n"
msgstr "# cd /usr/src\n# git remote --v\norigin  https://git.freebsd.org/src.git (fetch)\norigin  https://git.freebsd.org/src.git (push)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:803
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This indicates that [.filename]#/usr/src/# is under version control and can "
"be updated with man:git[1]:"
msgstr "这表示 [.filename]#/usr/src/# 受版本控制，可以使用 man:git[1] 更新："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:808
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# git -C /usr/src pull\n"
msgstr "# git -C /usr/src pull\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:812
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The update process can take some time if the directory has not been updated "
"recently.  After it finishes, the source code is up to date and the build "
"process described in the next section can begin."
msgstr ""
"若该目录最近没有更新过，可能会需要一些时间来完成更新动作。在更新完成之后，源"
"码便为最新版本，并可开始依下一章节的说明来编译程序。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:816
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Updating the Source"
msgid "Obtaining the source:"
msgstr "更新源码"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:819
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the output says `fatal: not a git repository`, the files there are "
"missing or were installed with a different method.  A new checkout of the "
"source is required."
msgstr "如果输出显示 `fatal: not a git repository`，则该目录中的文件缺失，或是通过其他方式安装的。需要重新检出源代码。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:822
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "FreeBSD Versions and Repository Branches"
msgstr "FreeBSD 版本与仓库分支"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:826
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "uname&#160;&#8209;r Output"
msgstr "uname&#160;&#8209;r 输出"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:827
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Repository Path"
msgstr "仓库路径"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:829
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Description"
msgstr "说明"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:830
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`_X.Y_-RELEASE`"
msgstr "`_X.Y_-RELEASE`"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:831
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`releng/_X.Y_`"
msgstr "`releng/_X.Y_`"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:833
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "The Release version plus only critical security and bug fix patches. This branch is recommended for most users."
msgstr "发行版本，仅包含关键安全补丁和错误修复。此分支适合大多数用户。"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:834
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`_X.Y_-STABLE`"
msgstr "`_X.Y_-STABLE`"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:835
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`stable/_X_`"
msgstr "`stable/_X_`"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:841
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Release version plus all additional development on that branch. _STABLE_ refers to the Applications Binary Interface (ABI) not changing, so software compiled for earlier versions still runs. For example, software compiled to run on FreeBSD {rel-legacy} will still run on FreeBSD {rel-legacy-major}-STABLE compiled later.\n"
"\n"
"STABLE branches occasionally have bugs or incompatibilities which might affect users, although these are typically fixed quickly."
msgstr "发行版本加上该分支中的所有后续开发内容。_STABLE_ 表示应用程序二进制接口（ABI）不会发生变化，因此为早期版本编译的软件仍可运行。例如，为 FreeBSD {rel-legacy} 编译的软件，在之后编译的 FreeBSD {rel-legacy-major}-STABLE 上仍可运行。\n\nSTABLE 分支偶尔会出现可能影响用户的错误或不兼容问题，但通常会很快修复。"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:842
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`_X_-CURRENT`"
msgstr "`_X_-CURRENT`"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:843
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`main`"
msgstr "`main`"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:844
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "The latest unreleased development version of FreeBSD. The CURRENT branch can have major bugs or incompatibilities and is recommended only for advanced users."
msgstr "FreeBSD 最新的未发布开发版本。CURRENT 分支可能存在严重错误或不兼容问题，因此仅建议高级用户使用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:847
#, fuzzy
msgid "Determine which version of FreeBSD is being used with man:uname[1]:"
msgstr "使用 man:uname[1] 确定正在使用的 FreeBSD 版本："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:852
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# uname -r\n"
"13.2-RELEASE\n"
msgstr "# uname -r\n13.2-RELEASE\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:856
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Based on crossref:cutting-edge[updating-src-obtaining-src-repopath,FreeBSD "
"Versions and Repository Branches], the source used to update `13.2-RELEASE` "
"has a repository path of `releng/13.2`.  That path is used when checking out "
"the source:"
msgstr "根据 crossref:cutting-edge[updating-src-obtaining-src-repopath,FreeBSD 版本与仓库分支]，用于更新 `13.2-RELEASE` 的源代码对应的仓库路径为 `releng/13.2`。检出源代码时会使用该路径："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:861
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# mv /usr/src /usr/src.bak <.>\n"
"# git clone --branch releng/13.2 https://git.FreeBSD.org/src.git /usr/src <.>\n"
msgstr "# mv /usr/src /usr/src.bak <.>\n# git clone --branch releng/13.2 https://git.FreeBSD.org/src.git /usr/src <.>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:864
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Move the old directory out of the way. If there are no local modifications "
"in this directory, it can be deleted."
msgstr ""
"将旧的目录移到其他地方，若没有在这个目录做过任何本地修改，可直接删除这个目"
"录。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:866
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The path from crossref:cutting-edge[updating-src-obtaining-src-repopath,"
"FreeBSD Versions and Repository Branches] is added to the repository URL. "
"The third parameter is the destination directory for the source code on the "
"local system."
msgstr "将 crossref:cutting-edge[updating-src-obtaining-src-repopath,FreeBSD 版本与仓库分支] 中的路径添加到仓库 URL。第三个参数是本地系统上源代码的目标目录。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:868
#, no-wrap
msgid "Building from Source"
msgstr "从源码编译"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:873
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The _world_, or all of the operating system except the kernel, is compiled.  "
"This is done first to provide up-to-date tools to build the kernel.  Then "
"the kernel itself is built:"
msgstr "编译 _world_，即除内核之外的整个操作系统。首先编译它，以提供构建内核所需的最新工具。然后构建内核本身："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:879
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# cd /usr/src\n"
"# make buildworld\n"
"# make buildkernel\n"
msgstr "# cd /usr/src\n# make buildworld\n# make buildkernel\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:882
#, fuzzy
msgid "The compiled code is written to [.filename]#/usr/obj#."
msgstr "编译后的代码写入 [.filename]#/usr/obj#。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:885
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "These are the basic steps. Additional options to control the build are "
#| "described below."
msgid ""
"These are the basic steps.  Additional options to control the build are "
"described below."
msgstr "以上这些均为基本的步骤，用来控制编译的其他选项在以下章节会说明。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:887
#, no-wrap
msgid "Performing a Clean Build"
msgstr "执行清除编译"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:892
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some versions of the FreeBSD build system leave previously-compiled code in "
"the temporary object directory, [.filename]#/usr/obj#.  This can speed up "
"later builds by avoiding recompiling code that has not changed.  To force a "
"clean rebuild of everything, use `cleanworld` before starting a build:"
msgstr "某些版本的 FreeBSD 构建系统会将先前编译的代码保留在临时对象目录 [.filename]#/usr/obj# 中。这样可以避免重新编译未更改的代码，从而加快后续构建。要强制从头干净地重新构建所有内容，请在开始构建前使用 `cleanworld`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:896
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# make cleanworld\n"
msgstr "# make cleanworld\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:899
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting the Number of Jobs"
msgstr "设定工作数量"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:906
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Increasing the number of build jobs on multi-core processors can improve "
"build speed.  Determine the number of cores with `sysctl hw.ncpu`.  "
"Processors vary, as do the build systems used with different versions of "
"FreeBSD, so testing is the only sure method to tell how a different number "
"of jobs affects the build speed.  For a starting point, consider values "
"between half and double the number of cores.  The number of jobs is "
"specified with `-j`."
msgstr ""
"在多核处理器上增加编译工作的数量可增加编译速度，可使用<command>sysctl hw."
"ncpu</command>来查看有多少核心，不同处理器使用不同版本的FreeBSD编译系统，所以"
"唯一能了解不同工作数量对编译速度影响的方式便是测试。在一开始可考虑选择一个介"
"于1/2到2倍核心数之间的数值，工作的数量可使用<option>-j</option>来指定。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:908
#, no-wrap
msgid "Increasing the Number of Build Jobs"
msgstr "增加编译工作数"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:912
msgid "Building the world and kernel with four jobs:"
msgstr "使用四个工作来编译世界与核心："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:916
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# make -j4 buildworld buildkernel\n"
msgstr "# make -j4 buildworld buildkernel\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:921
#, no-wrap
msgid "Building Only the Kernel"
msgstr "只编译内核"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:926
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A `buildworld` must be completed if the source code has changed.  After "
"that, a `buildkernel` to build a kernel can be run at any time.  To build "
"just the kernel:"
msgstr "如果源代码有更改，则必须完成一次 `buildworld`。之后，随时都可以运行 `buildkernel` 来构建内核。仅构建内核："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:931
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# cd /usr/src\n"
"# make buildkernel\n"
msgstr "# cd /usr/src\n# make buildkernel\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:934
#, no-wrap
msgid "Building a Custom Kernel"
msgstr "编译自定义核心"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:939
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The standard FreeBSD kernel is based on a _kernel config file_ called [."
"filename]#GENERIC#.  The [.filename]#GENERIC# kernel includes the most "
"commonly-needed device drivers and options.  Sometimes it is useful or "
"necessary to build a custom kernel, adding or removing device drivers or "
"options to fit a specific need."
msgstr ""
"标准的FreeBSD核心是以一个名为<filename>GENERIC</filename>的<emphasis>核心配置"
"文件（Kernel config file）</emphasis>为基础，<filename>GENERIC</filename>核心"
"中内含了所有最常用的装置驱动程序与选项，有时这个文件对编译自定义核心也非常有"
"用，可根据其来加入或移除装置驱动程序或选项来满足特定需求。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:941
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For example, someone developing a small embedded computer with severely "
"limited RAM could remove unneeded device drivers or options to make the "
"kernel slightly smaller."
msgstr ""
"例如，要开发一个<acronym>RAM</acronym>受到严重限制的小型嵌入式电脑，便可移除"
"不需要的装置驱动程序或选项来缩小核心。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:944
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Kernel config files are located in [.filename]#/usr/src/sys/arch/conf/#, "
"where _arch_ is the output from `uname -m`.  On most computers, that is "
"`amd64`, giving a config file directory of [.filename]#/usr/src/sys/amd64/"
"conf/#."
msgstr "内核配置文件位于 [.filename]#/usr/src/sys/arch/conf/#，其中 _arch_ 是 `uname -m` 的输出。在大多数计算机上，该值为 `amd64`，因此配置文件目录为 [.filename]#/usr/src/sys/amd64/conf/#。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:950
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"[.filename]#/usr/src# can be deleted or recreated, so it is preferable to "
"keep custom kernel config files in a separate directory, like [.filename]#/"
"root#.  Link the kernel config file into the [.filename]#conf# directory.  "
"If that directory is deleted or overwritten, the kernel config can be re-"
"linked into the new one."
msgstr ""
"<filename>/usr/src</filename>可以被删除或重建，所以较建议将自定义核心配置文件"
"放在另一个目录，如<filename>/root</filename>，并将核心配置文件以连接放至"
"<filename>conf</filename>目录，若该目录被删除或复写，便可重新建立一个新的核心"
"设定的连接。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:954
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A custom config file can be created by copying the [.filename]#GENERIC# "
"config file.  In this example, the new custom kernel is for a storage "
"server, so is named [.filename]#STORAGESERVER#:"
msgstr ""
"自定义配置文件可由复制<filename>GENERIC</filename>配置文件来建立，在此示例，"
"新的自定义核心要用在储存服务器，所以将其命名为<filename>STORAGESERVER</"
"filename>："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:960
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# cp /usr/src/sys/amd64/conf/GENERIC /root/STORAGESERVER\n"
"# cd /usr/src/sys/amd64/conf\n"
"# ln -s /root/STORAGESERVER .\n"
msgstr "# cp /usr/src/sys/amd64/conf/GENERIC /root/STORAGESERVER\n# cd /usr/src/sys/amd64/conf\n# ln -s /root/STORAGESERVER .\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:963
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"[.filename]#/root/STORAGESERVER# is then edited, adding or removing devices "
"or options as shown in man:config[5]."
msgstr "然后编辑 [.filename]#/root/STORAGESERVER#，按照 man:config[5] 中的说明添加或删除设备和选项。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:965
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The custom kernel is built by setting `KERNCONF` to the kernel config file "
"on the command line:"
msgstr "通过在命令行将 `KERNCONF` 设置为内核配置文件来构建自定义内核："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:969
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# make buildkernel KERNCONF=STORAGESERVER\n"
msgstr "# make buildkernel KERNCONF=STORAGESERVER\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:972
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing the Compiled Code"
msgstr "安装编译好的程序"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:975
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After the `buildworld` and `buildkernel` steps have been completed, the new "
"kernel and world are installed:"
msgstr "完成 `buildworld` 和 `buildkernel` 步骤后，安装新的内核和 world："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:984
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# cd /usr/src\n"
"# make installkernel\n"
"# shutdown -r now\n"
"# cd /usr/src\n"
"# make installworld\n"
"# shutdown -r now\n"
msgstr "# cd /usr/src\n# make installkernel\n# shutdown -r now\n# cd /usr/src\n# make installworld\n# shutdown -r now\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:987
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If a custom kernel was built, `KERNCONF` must also be set to use the new "
"custom kernel:"
msgstr "如果构建了自定义内核，还必须设置 `KERNCONF` 以使用新的自定义内核："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:996
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# cd /usr/src\n"
"# make installkernel KERNCONF=STORAGESERVER\n"
"# shutdown -r now\n"
"# cd /usr/src\n"
"# make installworld\n"
"# shutdown -r now\n"
msgstr "# cd /usr/src\n# make installkernel KERNCONF=STORAGESERVER\n# shutdown -r now\n# cd /usr/src\n# make installworld\n# shutdown -r now\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:999
#, no-wrap
msgid "Completing the Update"
msgstr "完成更新"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:1003
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
