#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:1113
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Starting from 14.0-RELEASE, the FreeBSD project has published a set of "
"packages of the base system, using man:pkg[8].  The convenience of pkg is no "
"longer limited to the FreeBSD ports collection.  man:pkg[8] can be used for "
"FreeBSD itself.  Base packages, and usage thereof, were traditionally "
"referred to as _pkgbase_."
msgstr "从 14.0-RELEASE 开始，FreeBSD 项目使用 man:pkg[8] 发布了一组基本系统软件包。pkg 的便利性不再局限于 FreeBSD Ports 集合。man:pkg[8] 也可用于 FreeBSD 本身。基本系统软件包及其用法过去通常称为 __pkgbase__。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:1116
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Publication of official packages began in link:https://lists.freebsd.org/"
"archives/freebsd-pkgbase/2023-October/000221.html[October 2023].  Their use "
"with FreeBSD 14 is currently experimental."
msgstr "官方软件包于 link:https://lists.freebsd.org/archives/freebsd-pkgbase/2023-October/000221.html[2023 年 10 月] 开始发布。目前，在 FreeBSD 14 上使用这些软件包仍属实验性质。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:1118
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Starting from 15.0-RELEASE, man:freebsd-base[7] will be supported as a tech "
"preview for:"
msgstr "从 15.0-RELEASE 开始，man:freebsd-base[7] 将作为技术预览支持以下用途："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:1120
#, fuzzy
msgid "installation"
msgstr "安装"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:1121
#, fuzzy
msgid "minor upgrades"
msgstr "次要升级"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:1122
#, fuzzy
msgid "major upgrades"
msgstr "主要升级"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:1124
#, fuzzy
