"tarball distribution sets, such as `base.txz` or `kernel.txz`, which are "
"historically used for installation of the OS with man:bsdinstall[8]"
msgstr "tarball 格式的发行集，例如 `base.txz` 或 `kernel.txz`。这些发行集过去通常与 man:bsdinstall[8] 一起用于安装操作系统"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:1127
#, fuzzy
msgid "man:freebsd-update[8] for updates to the OS."
msgstr "用于更新操作系统的 man:freebsd-update[8]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:1129
#, fuzzy
msgid "The current plan is for freebsd-update to work with pkg."
msgstr "目前的计划是让 freebsd-update 与 pkg 配合使用。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:1133
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The replacement of distribution sets will take some time, until freebsd-base "
"is fully stable!"
msgstr "替代发行集需要一些时间，freebsd-base 才能完全稳定！"

#. type: Plain text
