msgstr "# env ABI=FreeBSD:15:amd64 pkg-static -c /mnt/upgrade upgrade -r FreeBSD-base\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/cutting-edge/_index.adoc:1332
#, fuzzy
